WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:03.704 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont tenté de se lever contre ce

00:00:01.902 --> 00:00:03.704 size:53% position:73% line:53%
coup de force, comme nous le dit

00:00:02.903 --> 00:00:03.704 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Laurence Martin.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.642 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est la riposte

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.676 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que tout le monde attendait.

00:00:07.975 --> 00:00:10.677 size:53% position:73% line:53%
En début d'après-midi

00:00:08.976 --> 00:00:11.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Washington, Joe Biden a

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.180 size:53% position:73% line:53%
indiqué qu'il n'était

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.180 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas dupe des agissements

00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:13.180 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Vladimir Poutinmir Poutinmir.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:18.952 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et que pour lui,

00:00:17.251 --> 00:00:19.953 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la reconnaissance de régions

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:20.954 size:53% position:73% line:53%
séparatistes de Donetsk et

00:00:19.286 --> 00:00:26.326 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Louhansk par Moscou

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:26.326 size:53% position:73% line:53%
signifiait le début d'une

00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:26.326 size:53% position:73% line:53%
invasion russe en Ukraine.

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.497 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Malgré l'escalade, Joe Biden

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:35.269 size:53% position:73% line:53%
répète qu'il n'a nullement

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:36.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'intention d'envoyer

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:37.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des troupes sur le terrain.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.305 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il annonce tout de même

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:39.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des sanctions.

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:40.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Entre autres, contre

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.375 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des institutions financières

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:42.576 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et des élites russes.

00:00:40.674 --> 00:00:43.810 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Quelques heures plus tard,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Ottawa, Justin Trudeau an

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.246 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des mesures similaires.

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.447 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JUSTIN TRUDEAU,

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.682 size:53% position:73% line:53%
premier ministre du Canada

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.883 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On va imposer des sanctions

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:51.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
supplémentaires contre

00:00:49.016 --> 00:00:52.319 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les banques russes soutenues

00:00:50.217 --> 00:00:53.553 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par l'État, et interdire

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:54.788 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toute transaction

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
financière avec elles.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le gouvernement 

00:00:55.122 --> 00:00:58.425 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enverra aussi plus de militaires

00:00:56.323 --> 00:00:59.626 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans la région, en Lettonie,

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.861 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour renforcer son appui

00:00:58.759 --> 00:01:02.062 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'OTAN. Et ce n'est

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:03.297 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'un début, dit Mélanie Joly.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:04.531 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MÉLANIE JOLY, ministre

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:05.732 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des Affaires étrangères

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'invasion a commencé.

00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:08.168 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Nous répondons donc

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:09.403 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aujourd' la russie va

00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:10.604 size:53% position:73% line:53%
intensifier ses actions, plus

00:01:08.502 --> 00:01:11.838 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les actions du Canada et

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:13.040 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de nos alliés vont

00:01:10.938 --> 00:01:14.274 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s'intensifier.

00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:15.475 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vernement fédéral

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:16.710 size:53% position:73% line:53%
implore d'ailleurs

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:17.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses ressortissants

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:19.146 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui se trouvent encore

00:01:17.044 --> 00:01:20.347 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en Ukraine de rentrer au pays.

00:01:18.245 --> 00:01:21.581 size:53% position:73% line:53%
LIDIA WOLANSKYJ,

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.783 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canadienne en Ukraine

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.984 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Absolument non.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:25.218 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pourquoi pas?

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:26.420 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Non, je n'ai pas besoin de

00:01:25.152 --> 00:01:27.654 size:53% position:73% line:53%
partir.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.889 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Un appel que n'entend pas

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:30.090 size:53% position:73% line:53%
écouter Lidia Wolansky,

00:01:27.988 --> 00:01:31.325 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une Canadienne installée dans

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:32.526 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'ouest de l'État depuis 30 ans.

00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:33.760 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'ai pas de désir d'évacuer

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:34.962 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'Ukraine maintenant. Je ne sens

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:36.964 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas un danger direct.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:38.165 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'ai espoir que les grands pays

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:47.808 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme l'Europe, les Américains,

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:48.976 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les Canadiens, vont réagir assez

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:50.210 size:53% position:73% line:53%
efficacement maintenant.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.445 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais cet expert en sécurité

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:52.646 size:53% position:73% line:53%
internationale doute que

00:01:50.544 --> 00:01:53.880 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les sanctions économiques

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:55.082 size:53% position:73% line:53%
imposées jusqu'à maintenant

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:56.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
freinent l'ardeur

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:57.517 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Vladimir Poutine.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:58.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les sanctions ne sont pas tant

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:59.986 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vues pour prévenir

00:01:57.851 --> 00:02:01.188 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le comportement russe

00:01:59.086 --> 00:02:02.389 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que pour le punir.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les pays occidentaux ont

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:04.858 size:53% position:73% line:53%
promis d'ailleurs de punir

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:06.059 size:53% position:73% line:53%
davantage la Russie si Moscou

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:07.294 size:53% position:73% line:53%
intensifie son offensive.

00:02:05.192 --> 00:02:08.495 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La voie diplomatique

00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:09.729 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reste ouverte, répètent

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.930 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les États-Unis, même si elle

00:02:08.829 --> 00:02:15.002 size:53% position:73% line:53%
semble de plus en plus fermée.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:15.002 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Laurence Martin,

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:15.002 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Ottawa.

